        "Id": 80,
        "ActionId": 80,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 81,
        "ActionId": 81,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "Yes, but that's just what I heard from some of the mechanoids.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 82,
        "ActionId": 82,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "My sixth sense tells me that he is here, though.",
            2
